 "verdict": "THE METHOD WORKS AND THE LAYER DOES NOT, AND THOSE ARE DIFFERENT RESULTS. First, the correction: fix_sl.py called synthetic lethality externally blocked because DepMap's portal is behind a verification challenge. That is one host, not the source -- this project's own depmap_codep.py was already fetching the identical release from figshare, md5s asserted, and it was open the whole time. THE STATISTIC FINDS KNOWN SYNTHETIC LETHALITY. Scored outside the scan's own filters so no filter can empty the benchmark, the 20 published pairs sit at median percentile 2.38% of 47,798,592 tested pairs against 50.0% for random pairs from the same candidate sets -- 21x enrichment, Mann-Whitney p 5.2e-08, with 7/20 in the top 1%. RPP25 -> RPP25L is rank 3 of 47.8 million and MTAP -> PRMT5 is in the top 0.2%. THE DISCOVERED SET IS NOT PROMOTED, for a reason that has nothing to do with the above: at 5% FDR the cut admits only 5 pairs, and 100% of them point at 4 dependency genes. That shape is a cell-state marker, not 5 independent genetic interactions, and a within-lineage null over 29 coarse Oncotree lineages cannot remove a programme that cuts across them. WHY THE LAYER IS SMALL IS ALSO MEASURABLE, and it is the deficiency definition rather than the statistic: only 4 of 20 published pairs have a deficient gene this panel ever SILENCES (expression gap >= 2 log2). The other 16 are lost by copy number or mutation at gaps of 0.7-1.2 log2, and an expression cut sees a shadow of them -- a shadow that is still enough to rank SMARCA4 -> SMARCA2 in the top 0.1%, which is more than I predicted for it. That split is measured from each gene's own expression, not assumed: my first pass classified 17 pairs as reachable by mechanism and only 2 of them are. The `sl` name is now attached to the right relationship either way: the old layer's pairs sit at mean t +0.515, on the co-dependency side of zero, which is the opposite sign and independently confirms the rename. NEXT: copy number is the deficiency state this needs, it is in the same figshare release, and it would reach the 16 pairs expression cannot.",
